     A**********************************************************
     A* IVPPRTPRT
     A* Item printed price and third-party approval
     A**********************************************************
     A* SOS-2092 and SOS-2520, combined as SOS-2520 asks. A file of
     A* its own, keyed by item, rather than new fields on IVPITEMS:
     A* adding to IVPITEMS would mean recompiling every program that
     A* uses it, and the SYNC_IVPITEMS triggers copy that record to
     A* another system.
     A*
     A* No row for an item means both are unknown - the same as
     A* blank. Rows are only needed for items where something is
     A* known, so nothing has to be loaded for the rest.
     A*
     A* PRTPRC  is the price printed on the product?
     A*           Y  yes
     A*           N  no
     A*           S  stickered on receipt (imports and distributed
     A*              titles that arrive without a US price)
     A*           blank  not known
     A*
     A* TPAPRV  does a price change need third-party approval?
     A*           Y  yes - a price change must be approved first
     A*           N  no
     A*           blank  not known
     A*
     A* Changes are audited in IVPMAINT under FLDNAM PRTPRC and
     A* TPAPRV, the way every other item field is.
     A**********************************************************
     A                                      REF(OBJECT/FIELD_REF FIELD$REF)
     A                                      UNIQUE
     A          R IV$PRTPRT                 TEXT('Printed price and approval')
     A            ITMNUM    R
     A            PRTPRC         1A         TEXT('Printed price Y N S blank')
     A                                      COLHDG('PRINTED' 'PRICE')
     A            TPAPRV         1A         TEXT('3rd party approval Y N blnk')
     A                                      COLHDG('3RD PARTY' 'APPROVAL')
     A            ADDTS           Z         TEXT('Add timestamp')
     A                                      COLHDG('ADD' 'TS')
     A            ADDUSER       10A         TEXT('Add user')
     A                                      COLHDG('ADD' 'USER')
     A            CHGTS           Z         TEXT('Change timestamp')
     A                                      COLHDG('CHANGE' 'TS')
     A            CHGUSER       10A         TEXT('Change user')
     A                                      COLHDG('CHANGE' 'USER')
     A          K ITMNUM
